## What and why

State it so someone who was not in the conversation can act. Not the title again
— what the task is for, what "done" looks like, and what would make it not worth
doing.

## Constraints

What blocks it and what it blocks. What it must not break. Whose decision
settled a fork, in their words where you have them — a direction recorded as
"we decided X" loses the reasoning that makes X revisable.

## Log

