Oldest first: this is a working record and reads chronologically, unlike
`{{FINDINGS_FILE}}`, where the newest entry is the one you came for. What was
tried, what it cost, what was ruled out **and why it was ruled out** — that last
clause is the one that stops the same dead end being retried in three sessions.

## Produced

Links to what the work made: specs, design docs, research notes, the commits.
One hop from the row to the artifacts, rather than a grep.

